          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "T-S Misc.28.11 verso, address, right column",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>(To) my lord the excellent elder, Ab\u016b al-\u1e24asan Sur\u016br&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>b. \u1e24ayyim,&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>known as Sabra,&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>may God prolong his life and make lasting his honor&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and protection.&nbsp;</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
